          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "1a8b5d04-9eef-4456-a1fa-9d010878e87e",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "7cebd8f6-9601-47a6-a8d9-e60f166d9ba3",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "4076ba10-bf84-4b6e-acac-b7ca1a8c0970",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Moxie has six\nsmall parcels for\nthe first round.\nHer roof harness\ncarries three at a",
                      "time; the covered\nhandcart carries\nall six. The high\nline is checked in\ntwo trips, and the",
                      "covered line in\none. Neither route\nhas a timer. The\nclinic wants a\ncomplete delivery",
                      "record, not a\nspeed boast. Moxie\nasks how many",
                      "trips the larger\ncart saves on this\nround."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "24197ce4-de1b-43bf-a654-3ae42aa1d1a5",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "206bf34f-3cc9-4cc1-aeaf-3f0c3829d4bb",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
