        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "7d7c3056-882a-48ac-a231-c5c866e056f8",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "f325c043-79af-4ce4-ae22-5cf698d6c626",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "f68bed54-e83d-4444-a419-08d3e9599650",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The vane bears two\nservice marks:\nHIGH for the roof\ncircuit, COVER for\nthe sheltered",
                      "clinic circuit.\nThis sets your\ndelivery plan.\nBoth routes stay\nwalkable, and the",
                      "city will remember\nwhich promise you\nmade."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "1be389cc-f2a8-4121-a28f-a95c2ff8739a",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fe13f4d0-8c8a-4d44-abaf-cb3b11d9be8f",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "b77ef86d-b2db-4646-a964-f2f59b9b090e",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "82e62871-6bb0-40de-ad40-ab6749253fee",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "445175ac-52ee-475a-ae11-e6fb4801fdc3",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Use the capacity\ncard to compare\nthe six-parcel\nload. How many\nfewer trips does",
                      "the covered\nhandcart need than\nthe roof harness?\nYour route choice\nremains valid",
                      "either way: the\nanswer tells Moxie\nhow to staff it. A\nroof route can\nmake two honest",
                      "trips rather than\nclaim an\noverloaded harness\nis somehow more\nfestive."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "59202e33-4f4b-46e6-a6c1-1a5c8597c47e",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
